      "writtenOn": "2025-05-02T20:24:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is intentional, I\u0027ll add a comment explaining why it\u0027s like this. The host is the primary scheduler, so we need to return to it before retrying the current call. The host also handles any non-secure interrupts that might have interrupted TZ.",
