      "writtenOn": "2025-05-02T20:24:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I looked at that, don\u0027t we need to fill in a request structure for it?\n\nI still think `ARM_EXCEPTION_IRQ` is the most fitting, because the most likely reason TZ returned was a non-secure interrupts that the host needs to handle.",
