      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-06T12:37:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We will still exit to the host even though we don\u0027t have an explicit hyp request. I suggest we move the code that does :\n\n```\n\twrite_sysreg_el2(read_sysreg_el2(SYS_ELR) - 4, SYS_ELR);\n\t*exit_code \u003d ARM_EXCEPTION_HYP_REQ;\n```\n\nto a function `kvm_guest_replay_ffa_call` to avoid duplicating it.",
      "parentUuid": "baa1748f_c48a7f76",
